## Frontend Configuration Fix

### Problem
The `nucleus-hud` frontend was defaulting to `http://localhost:5055` because `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_API_URL` was not being passed during the Cloud Build process.

### Changes Made
1.  **[Dockerfile](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/nucleus-hud/Dockerfile)**: Added `ARG NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_API_URL` and `ENV NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_API_URL`.
2.  **[cloudbuild.yaml](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/cloudbuild.yaml)**: Added `--build-arg NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_API_URL=$_NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_API_URL`.
3.  **[.gcloudignore](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/.gcloudignore)**: Modified to whitelist `tools/nucleus-hud` while excluding other tools and `node_modules`.

### Deployment Status
*   **Revision**: `nucleus-hud-00005-bvq`
*   **URL**: `https://nucleus-hud-7an2ps6yna-uc.a.run.app`
*   **Auth**: Basic Auth enabled (Credentials: `admin`/`nucleus`)
*   **API Connectivity**: Configured to `https://nucleus.gentlequest.app`

### Verification
```bash
$ curl -s -u admin:nucleus https://nucleus-hud-7an2ps6yna-uc.a.run.app | head -5
# Returns full HTML with "IGNITE MISSION", "NEURAL UPLINK" UI components.
```
